GITCAPI  CSECT
         ENTRY GITCAPI
         EXTRN GITNAPI
* GCCCMS passes R1 -> argument list; first word is API block.
* R12 is volatile across this tail call; no return to adapter.
         BALR  12,0
         USING *,12
         L     1,0(1)
         L     15,=V(GITNAPI)
         BR    15
         LTORG
         END
